    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Capability Matcher - Semantic matching engine for shard selection</para>
<para>Analyzes queries and matches them against shard capabilities using:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Keyword-based matching (TF-IDF style)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Semantic similarity via embeddings (cosine distance)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Domain/organization/region/data-type specific scoring</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para>Returns ranked list of shards with relevance scores. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
